\section{Inspect Elaboration, Then Check Behavior}

\begin{verbatim}
choose top two_taps
for each tap instance:
    substitute that instance's W and REGISTERED
    constrain d and q to W bits       # shape before behavior
    keep exactly one generate branch
    if REGISTERED:
        create W indexed lane scopes  # independent concurrent work
check that q3 follows d3 after settling
check that q5 changes after a rising edge, then holds
\end{verbatim}

One can read the file in SystemVerilog mode and use the Yosys \href{https://yosyshq.readthedocs.io/projects/yosys/en/latest/cmd/index_passes_hierarchy.html#cmd-hierarchy}{\texttt{hierarchy} pass} with \verb|-check -top two_taps| to select and check a root and derive the parameterized variants. The tool's internal names need not match the spelling of every source scope; subsequent lowering or flattening can erase entire boundaries. Inspect one result before process lowering to understand specialization and another after lowering to understand register inference. A mapper can also replace the five individual bit registers with an equivalent vector register or target-specific storage primitive. Neither representation alone predicts cell count after optimizations, routing, or timing.

Replacing \verb|if (REGISTERED)| with a generate condition that reads an input port is illegal: the required condition is constant during elaboration. If the functional requirement is run-time selection between direct and captured data, describe both paths and a run-time mux. That circuit contains state even in direct mode, and switching modes requires its own timing and data-validity contract.

Do not confuse a generate loop with every other HDL loop. A procedural loop with constant bounds inside a clocked block can assign an entire bank on one edge; it does not imply an extra clock per iteration. But it does not create named scopes for separately instantiated modules and processes as this generate loop does. Conversely, to process one lane per cycle with a shared resource, describe the changing index as actual register state, provide phase or completion logic, and specify when results become available. That is a third design, not another spelling of the same hardware.
